# EVE rule test 3 — an argument the check passes but the block omits refuses the entry
zxapp 1
id eve_rule_3
matrix 1
name Eve Rule 3
provides r truth a b
logic eve r <<
eve t
counts = 1 .. 100

blk {
  count: counts 1 .. 100
}
.
